//! Array join/toLocaleString/sort/toSorted, quickjs.c:44039-44098,44737-44953,
//! pinned 7d1c13c5. Arguments borrow, successful results own. No heap payload
//! loan crosses a getter, coercion, comparator, setter, or collector callback.
